WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.400
How can I know God’s will

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.220
for my life?

3
00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:09.060
Romans twelve begins with God’s mercies before

4
00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:10.660
it speaks about discernment.

5
00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:12.140
Through Jesus Christ,

6
00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:14.500
God has shown mercy to people who

7
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:15.740
could never earn it.

8
00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:18.200
Then Paul calls believers to offer

9
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.420
their whole lives to God as worship.

10
00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:22.820
Before choosing between opportunities,

11
00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:24.360
you can begin here:

12
00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:25.160
Lord,

13
00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:26.660
I belong to you.

14
00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:28.740
How can this choice honor you?

15
00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:30.380
Think about your time,

16
00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:31.240
your work,

17
00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:33.360
and the people your decision will affect.

18
00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:35.540
You are approaching the God who has

19
00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:37.720
already given himself for you in Christ.

20
00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:40.340
His mercy gives you a secure place

21
00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:40.900
to begin,

22
00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:42.900
and a reason to offer him whatever

23
00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:43.760
comes next.
